	"name": "Poison and Pollution",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/acid/dissolve-drip-droplet-smoke.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You gain resistance to Poison damage and advantage on saving throws against Disease or Poison effects. In addition, you can use a bonus action to envenom your weapons. Doing so causes your next successful attack before the start of your next turn to deal 1d4 ongoing poison damage for up to 1 minute. You may use this ability a number of times equal to your Constitution modifier and recover all uses at the end of a short or long rest.</p>",
